B.acB=new A.ex("Not yet validated on patients. The weights are taken from published studies but the combined model has not been tested against video-EEG-confirmed diagnoses.",!1,null)
B.acD=new A.ex("Naive Bayes assumes findings are independent. They are not; damping reduces but does not remove overconfidence, so treat high percentages with caution.",!1,null)
B.acy=new A.ex("Decision support only. It does not replace clinical judgement, a specialist opinion or video-EEG.",!1,null)
B.acr=new A.ex("The output depends entirely on the quality of the witness account and the features you select.",!1,null)
B.acE=new A.ex("Epileptic seizures and PNES can coexist; the tool cannot detect dual diagnosis.",!1,null)
B.acF=new A.ex("Localization uses aura and semiology only. Rapid spread and non-localizing semiology can point to the wrong lobe.",!1,null)
B.acz=new A.ex("Not a regulated medical device.",!0,null)
