B.acL=new A.lT("2.0.2","17 November 2026",B.SO,!1,null)
B.Pg=s(["Calgary score: head turning now scores +2, as in Sheldon 2002 (was +1).","Content review: prolactin, visual aura, figure-of-4 and photosensitivity pearls corrected; ILAE 2017/2022 names for spasms, early infantile DEE and sleep-related hypermotor epilepsy."],t.s)
B.acK=new A.lT("2.0.1","13 November 2026",B.Pg,!1,null)
B.Qa=s(["New engine: naive-Bayes log-likelihood model with setting priors and damping of correlated signs.","Weights re-derived from published data with an evidence grade and source for each.","Corrected: ictal crying now favours PNES; urinary incontinence and a normal EEG no longer move the estimate; prolactin also rises after syncope; psychiatric history weighted down.","Added: eyes closed, waxing\u2013waning course, ictal recall, stertorous breathing, presyncopal prodrome, situational triggers, pallor, onset from sleep.","Calgary Syncope\u2013Seizure Score, cardiac and neurological red flags.","Lateralizing signs with side, and a hemisphere estimate.","Video-EEG and ECG results; EEG split into epileptiform vs non-specific.","Weight-of-evidence chart, named patterns, worked examples, copyable summary.","The Tract palette and typography, faster load, shareable URLs for every screen."],t.s)
B.acJ=new A.lT("2.0.0","5 November 2026",B.Qa,!1,null)
