B.GF=new A.cs("Syndromes","Catamenial pattern","Best confirmed with a seizure diary correlated against a menstrual calendar, not by history alone.",B.ex)
B.GH=new A.cs("Syndromes","Reflex epilepsy triggers","Photosensitive, reading, musicogenic, hot water and startle epilepsies share a stereotyped trigger-to-seizure relationship \u2014 ask specifically.",B.cm)
